 "cell_contents": "Four defect-normalized Mg0.215Fe0.762□0.023O formula units per conventional average rocksalt cell (Z=4). The average diffraction model does not resolve the tetrahedral Fe3+-vacancy defect clusters seen by room-pressure Mossbauer spectroscopy and diffuse scattering.",
